<title>USA: Pfizer to launch products.</title>
<headline>Pfizer to launch products.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pfizer Inc said Thursday it would launch two major new human pharmacuetical products early this year, and several new indications for existing products.</p>
<p>It said its imminent new product launches are Aricept, a treatment for Alzheimer's disease, and Lipitor, for the treatment of elevated blood-cholesterol levels.</p>
<p>Aricept was discovered and developed by Eisai Co Ltd. Lipitor was discovered and developed by Warner-Lambert Co.</p>
<p>Pfizer will co-promote and co-market these products.</p>
<p>Pfizer said it hopes to launch its Trovan antibiotic by the end of 1997 or early in 1998. It filed a new drug application for Trovan last month.</p>
</text>
